== About Me
I am a Ph.D. candidate in the [https://sai.cuhk.edu.cn/en School of Artificial Intelligence] at CUHK-Shenzhen, supervised by [http://chenjunting.org/ Prof. Junting Chen] and [https://sai.cuhk.edu.cn/en/teacher/159 Prof. Pooi-Yuen Kam]. I was a MSc in HIT-Shenzhen supervised by [https://faculty.hitsz.edu.cn/zhangtingting Prof. Tingting Zhang], and a BEng in UoG and UESTC supervised by [https://www.tudelft.nl/en/staff/f.fioranelli/ Prof. Francesco Fioranelli], [https://www.gla.ac.uk/schools/engineering/staff/julienlekernec/ Prof. Julien Le Kernec] and [https://www.auto.uestc.edu.cn/en/info/1032/1186.htm Prof. Jianguo Huang].

